==Battleground==
*3 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 3~6 seconds<sup>90f~180f</sup>.
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3~6 seconds<sup>90f~180f</sup>.
*4 [[Croco]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*4 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*5 [[Croco]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 1~3 seconds<sup>30f~90f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 1~3 seconds<sup>30f~90f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Osamu Mikumo & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**20 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Even at level 20, [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] can almost solo the stage. In 2 and 3-crown difficulties you might need a higher-level Artist/Ramen to stall Osamu Mikumo & Doge better. In 4-crown, bring along [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] and spawn him when there is a clear shot on the boss.

